<title>UK: UK's Newcastle says in talks with jt CEO.</title>
<headline>UK's Newcastle says in talks with jt CEO.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The board of Newcastle United Plc, the owner of the English football club, said on Monday it was in talks with Mark Corbridge, its joint chief executive, about his future in the company.</p>
<p>The company said it would make a further announcement in due course.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
</text>
